{"titleText":"WarSim\n\nWorld war simulator\n\nLanguage\nEnglish\nScenarios\nWorld, 1938\n1 January 1938\nRandom world\n1 January 1938\nScenario file\n\nStart from a .warsim-scenario file, as the editor exports them.\n\nRandom world\n\nThe earth, shared out anew among as many nations as you ask for. Every seed gives another world; the map here shows one of them.\n\nStart date\n1 January 1938\nMap\nEarth · 2048 × 1024\nNations\n2 to 200\nSeed\nRandom\nNations\nNew game options\nMap size\nSmall, 1024 × 512\nMedium, 2048 × 1024\nLarge, 4096 × 2048\nLooping map\nOn\nOff\nNation aggression\nAs in the scenario\nRandom\nNation traits\nAs in the scenario\nRandom\nStarting gold\nAs in the scenario\nRandom\nEqual for all\nCombat efficiency\nAs in the scenario\nDynamic\nProgressive\nStatic\nLocked\nRandom\nStart","bootS":4.327,"nations0":60,"yearS":35.331,"nations1":59,"ticker":["5 January 1939 · Paused","21 December 1938 Minas Gerais made peace with Santa Catarina","26 December 1938 Khulna made peace with Haryana","1 January 1939 Alaska made peace with British Columbia"],"errors":[]}
